# 10. Multiple exports

The user may click Export multiple times.

The Downloads panel should therefore support multiple export items.

Example:

```text
Downloads

┌─────────────────────────────────────┐
│ XLSX   Implementation_Listing.xlsx │
│        Export in progress...       │
│        Just now                    │
├─────────────────────────────────────┤
│ XLSX   Implementation_Listing.xlsx │
│        Export completed ✓          │
│        2 minutes ago               │
├─────────────────────────────────────┤
│ XLSX   Implementation_Listing.xlsx │
│        Export completed ✓          │
│        10 minutes ago              │
└─────────────────────────────────────┘
```

Newest export should appear at the top.

Different exports may have different completion times.

Do not assume that exports complete in the same order in which they were started.

For example:

```text
Export A → large → still processing
Export B → small → completed
```

The panel should correctly show:

```text
Export B
✓ Export completed

Export A
◌ Export in progress...
```

