# 11. Different export sizes

The purpose of this feature is specifically because exports can have very different sizes.

For example:

* Small export → completes quickly
* Medium export → takes some time
* Very large export → takes significantly longer

Do not artificially show a progress percentage unless the backend provides real progress information.

The UI should simply represent the actual state:

```text
In progress
      ↓
Completed
```

